~ ritual
You step towards the Altar,[wait=0.2] ready to sacrifice your beloved fish.
You hear a [shake rate=20 level=10]chant[/shake] coming from the Son's hut.
It is in a language you cannot understand.
...
Your fish has been transformed.
[wave amp=25 freq=5]It is... Beautifull.[/wave] Everyone is speechless.
They beg the Son to come to see,[wait=0.2] He peeks through his keyhole.
Before he could look,[wait=0.2] It,[wait=0.2] turns into dust and [wave amp=25 freq=5]blows away[/wave] with the wind.
You hear [shake rate=20 level=10]muttering[/shake] from the hut.
Around you,[wait=0.2] everyone is walking back to the town,[wait=0.2] just like this never happened.
=> END

